---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaPanel from '../components/CtaPanel.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Preventive Property Maintenance Plans in Middle Tennessee | Upkeep"
  description="Scheduled inspections, HVAC filter programs, gutter and roof checks, and seasonal upkeep for rental portfolios and homes across Nashville and Middle Tennessee."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Preventive Maintenance</span>
      <h1>Proactive, not reactive.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Deferred maintenance is the silent killer of property values. A
        preventive plan catches failing systems while they are still cheap to
        fix, and turns maintenance from an emergency into a calendar.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid grid-4">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Seasonal inspections</h3>
          <p>Spring and fall walk-throughs of every unit, documented with photos, so nothing deteriorates unseen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>HVAC filter program</h3>
          <p>Filters changed on schedule across the portfolio. The cheapest insurance an HVAC system can have.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Roof and gutter checks</h3>
          <p>Annual roof inspections and gutter cleaning before Middle Tennessee storm seasons find the weak spots.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Seasonal upkeep</h3>
          <p>Caulking, weatherstripping, smoke detector tests, and winterization, handled before the season demands it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>What a plan does for a portfolio</h2>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>Fewer emergency calls, because failures get caught early</li>
          <li>Longer system life, HVAC and water heaters especially</li>
          <li>A documented maintenance history for every unit</li>
          <li>Predictable budgeting instead of surprise capital expenses</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Built around your properties</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Plans are scoped per portfolio. We walk your units, flag what is
          aging, and build a schedule that matches how each property is
          actually used. Homeowners can enroll a single home the same way.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaPanel
    heading="Want problems caught before they cost you?"
    body="Call us or submit a request and we will scope a preventive plan for your properties."
  />
</Layout>
